29:["$","div",null,{"className":"leader__letter","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Dear Friends,"}],["$","p","1",{"children":"I have immense pleasure in welcoming you to Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital [IGCH], a highly progressive and enterprising hospital pledged to providing quality healthcare with great emphasis on traditional values."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"Bearing in mind that health is the only tool that uplifts the standard of society, there is a very wide prospect behind providing healthcare by IGCH, Ernakulam. The hospital has a vision of becoming an ideal centre for health care for the people around the city and surrounding districts, and not of revenue collection."}],["$","p","3",{"children":"Our dream is to be considered as a pioneer institution of health services, propagating, popularising medical science. We also have a plan to make the base wider to medical, paramedical, nursing and allied fields, which will help in availing medical treatment and health services at affordable cost to the needy ones. The hospital has already arranged the best infrastructure, experienced doctors & nursing staff, modern tools and methodologies."}],["$","p","4",{"children":"I firmly believe that health services should foster confidence, discipline, clarity in thought and decision-making at critical stages, and above all, social responsibility as a life-long process."}],["$","p","5",{"children":"IGCH takes pride in providing a caring atmosphere to all its patients just apt for the sick minds to be nurtured. It aims to develop scholarly students with great self-discipline, intense perseverance and a zeal to excel, which are the qualities required to meet the challenges of modern society. The hospital seeks utmost co-operation and support at all times to achieve the high standards set, from well-wishers like you."}],["$","p","6",{"children":"Thank you."}],["$","p","7",{"children":"Secretary"}],["$","p","8",{"children":"Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH)"}]]}]
